{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "a38b54ecf833ec29543266b6250dac0e682480f45521822c96b5f407e5d124c6", "ja": "試食とピンチ！", "zh": "试吃和危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5a2021c4b87b195e82fb55530f4b64b0c4973175694e85ae1caae29f1696c960", "ja": "さっそく女子力やきそばの試作品を作って\nきた海美。プロデューサーが勇気を出して\n食べてみると、見た目の割に美味しい。\nそこに海のステージ設営が間に合わないと\nいう連絡が入り、全員で手伝うことになる。", "zh": "海美很快便做出女子力炒面的试吃品。\n制作人鼓起勇气试吃后，\n发现炒面比外观看起来还要好吃。\n此时收到海边舞台来不及搭建的通知，\n全员决定一同过去帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb57aa04f49ebf04971e6e8db4e8e84d1cb9b93a0a800a71b688567223ce07ba", "ja": "（ようやく、閃光☆HANABI団関係の発注がすべて\n終わった。これなら、ライブに間に合いそうだな……）", "zh": "（『闪光☆HANABI团』的相关发包终于都搞定了。\n这样一来，应该就能赶上演唱会了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "c8446c6bf484a6e3b43234ce2ec93f8a2a191e1185c6586195f8e0b54ca1f1bf", "ja": "……あ、いたいた！\n{$P$}、発見！！", "zh": "……啊，找到了找到了！\n发现{$P$}了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a0011ae73d8d7a0d1812f4573ec28a4ccd374f0472b85ae994a0bf7b6e7f257a", "ja": "海美、お疲れさま。\n……ん？　なんかスパイシーな香りがするな。", "zh": "海美，你辛苦了。\n……嗯？我好像闻到香辛料的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "5f23a5750ff8474c9f51431e780d635fdc6bc8b6c6aa81927e38b44a05025b13", "ja": "えっへへ！　実はこれ……はいっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿！其实是这个啦……来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "728b0221b8fd8fdeffb667681931cc19514f0417918b8e667fdfb6e39f8866fd", "ja": "おっ、これは？\nすごいピンク色の……イソギンチャクか？", "zh": "哦，这是什么？\n是颜色很粉红的……海葵吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "bafc7d916af4aeb7e92b24be5b90d9af6ef14a99353df49af1b482dbf3fb7461", "ja": "ちがーうー！　これは女子力やきそばの試作品の\n試作品っ！　もー、待ちきれなくって作ってみたの！", "zh": "不～是～！这是女子力炒面的试作品的试作品！\n我等不及就先试做看看了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1c05d06cd3168b8083d0188e9efd0afc6512f08e1fb6f3b9d03d688729de44f0", "ja": "これが、やきそば……？　そうか、うん……。\nなんていうか、新しさを感じるやきそばだな！", "zh": "这是炒面……？这样啊，嗯……\n该怎么说呢，感觉真是新颖的炒面呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "a5018fb5190c384be984e6e8440dffbee828dc95b253bf521872618047a48b9f", "ja": "ねえねえ、食べてみて☆　{$P$}に\n一番に味見して欲しくて持ってきたんだ！", "zh": "欸欸，你吃吃看☆\n我想让{$P$}第一个试吃才拿来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "db1ec2f142c6c572b4f9a5faf549ea675e31690cb1e2a1d732b31bff98db2817", "ja": "そこは自分が一番でもいいと思うんだが……\nそ、そうだな……じゃあ……。", "zh": "我是觉得这种时候你可以第一个试吃……\n要、要我试吃啊……那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b805b134909ea682aaf45db2fdb58d29c586d15039f8eecd88fc3012652be6b1", "ja": "（この色、スパイシーかつ若干フローラルな香り……。\nしかし、海美が一生懸命作ったものだし……）", "zh": "（这个颜色，加上辛辣又带点花香的味道……\n不过，毕竟这是海美拚命做出来的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "06220cd522e64680aef78e97a8ce24fb62a40b99494403f1d16ff23608080021", "ja": "（ええい、ままよ！）", "zh": "（不管了，就吃下去吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3794f83e2923de66ebfb65125c11bb246b9117dd4182d22dae3cb63ac1fdfdf5", "ja": "パクッ", "zh": "（咬）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "377b7472da9d1b10742b7415667f660af2d0160b0c7879289085a0021fe84277", "ja": "ね、どうかなっ！？　おいしいかなっ！？", "zh": "欸，怎么样！？好吃吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b7f7a26cf274c0e57127bffc4d168b9594004ca783cf7f0ace8781f3c2368104", "ja": "（なんだこれは……普通に……うまい！？）", "zh": "（这是怎么回事……意外地……还算好吃！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2105a9ec0d8c8428d87a4700797eb7c6a5d63f9ccdab118b80dd0be0ce32617d", "ja": "おいしいぞ……おいしいじゃないか、海美！\nうん、これならお客さんも喜ぶはずだ！", "zh": "好吃……很好吃嘛，海美！\n嗯，这样观众吃了应该也会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "984686ac934cee946b31e0ad496ed22e0f254581be735d3aada63dcefb1444aa", "ja": "ほんとに！？\nやったぁああああ～っ☆　やったやった！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n太棒啦啊啊啊啊～☆太棒了太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "763341a8a3cb6e6cc8537ddca256ff0493757a7547a98728a469ee368539686b", "ja": "えへへ……実はね、莉緒ねぇに女子力っぽいスパイスの\n情報とか聞いて、ネットで買ったのを入れてみたの！", "zh": "嘿嘿……其实啊，我有先向莉绪大姊打听\n有关女子力的香辛料情报，才去网路上买来添加看看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "5fe2ecc4c387a8859c19e1bf16f19648c46a4bc590cc84ffb11640934880e426", "ja": "あのね、そのサイトすごいんだよ！\n女子力に関するものは、何でも揃ってるのっ！", "zh": "我跟你说，那个网站很厉害喔！\n有关女子力的东西，网站上全部都有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "26ce670eda7ce0f0af91ecba1b0f0378fbf7c4b89c67045a6b229862308e5e02", "ja": "へえ、さすが莉緒……\n女子力に関して、色々アンテナを張ってるんだな。", "zh": "是喔，真不愧是莉绪……\n她非常关注女子力的相关资讯呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3a287c6003675bf5f9dfa882269d8981d6c2605d50884018c9312973882d4643", "ja": "海美。このやきそば、\n他のみんなにも試食してもらうのか？", "zh": "海美，这盘炒面，\n你也要拿去给其他人试吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "669172c06c7f0ad4d2db8f180f85e1a9dd5c4b2dd3c662734a0b3a2c3615e7ad", "ja": "ううん！　私の女子力は、まだこんなもんじゃないよ！\nまだまだパワーアップさせるつもり！", "zh": "没有！我的女子力可不只这样喔！\n我还打算要继续加强它！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "8912c27f5a23cbe14860fbc18c05a8f6bb7233725b96a43d0a4203e04a8b126f", "ja": "だから{$P$}も、それまで秘密に\nしてて！　みんなをびっくりさせたいんだ～☆", "zh": "所以{$P$}，完成之前你也要保密喔！\n我想让大家吓一跳～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1abd215d40bfacf9d9418b5b5b3c699a21fad71550820c38d9f6b2b334bc0765", "ja": "そうか。期待して待ってるぞ！\n……ん？　電話……海美、ちょっと待ってくれ。", "zh": "这样啊，我会好好期待的！\n……嗯？有电话……海美，你等我一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3ab938cd1cb656883ea8229e351a6a803ff905ea2ddec0101b2449c380862645", "ja": "はい、765プロ……はい、そうですが……\nえっ！？　海のステージが間に合わない！？", "zh": "你好，我是765艺能的……是，没错……\n咦！？海边舞台来不及完成！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "3fa0c4e402960a79d55a11957337fc3553404b1e4416f3e7e5c3e40bcb1fb27f", "ja": "天候が悪くて、設営の時間が足りない……\nいえ、こちらも無理を言ってすみません。", "zh": "因为天气太差，搭建时间不够……\n不会，我才要抱歉太强人所难了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "a46bfb6a397a36609c7936e79e3116cc322131c4bcb42609dbf2eba6b54daec9", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "881e89efc12d26e194307f329ba9295185388a7b9d3c37b34c702645ace3eb64", "ja": "お疲れさまー！", "zh": "辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "51e1a5d30987bc3a506cf1df338bcf71effb133bc56ac66918b8602a7e26fd8d", "ja": "シーッ！　さよちん、のりさん、シーッ！", "zh": "嘘──！纱纱、阿法姊，嘘──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "f0fe114102cc66404996abed0e3f9380935a5e4b0cd27b1f67c4f8453e870898", "ja": "？　海美、どうかしたの？", "zh": "咦？海美，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "91c7d318a58a471047da77ab7a645ceb645e874be02acb03c7c1ede71411e547", "ja": "それが……。", "zh": "就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "25bbc37332e5fdcf709eb26ec27e84aaa0cf159b6fb1ba462424fc27464eafd2", "ja": "……わかりました。こちらでも、何か対策を考えて\nみます。いえ、すみません。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "……我明白了，那我这边也会想想看对策。\n不会，不好意思，麻烦你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "383ee872f2c44b3cf6afc7e62d27346076e79103685044a23b270197a7b177e6", "ja": "{$P$}……\n海のステージ、間に合わないの？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n海边舞台，来不及盖好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "c32425addbd50dd2480489f9d9510578d2a8f07d594923dcf381ef7b6f8e2687", "ja": "えっ……そうなの！？　大変じゃん！", "zh": "咦……真的吗！？那不就问题大了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8caf4fed9f35380ab2b0b96974ce2a0f9a09d2ea2e9563bb2865610c42d95e0e", "ja": "のり子、紗代子も来てたのか……うん、そのようだ。\nここのところ、天候不良が続いたからな……。", "zh": "法子、纱代子你们也来了啊……嗯，似乎是这样。\n因为最近天气一直很不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "fc95010ad978d74504de5412332bfc04fa6a0baa9033a494369f2d1eb585c6f5", "ja": "でも、大丈夫だ。予定通りのセットは組めないかも\nしれないけど、できるところまではやるから……。", "zh": "不过没关系。虽然布景可能无法完全按照预定搭建，\n但会尽量能盖多少是多少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "f3889bc9b92cfb5b8c3b4ba13ad6a93280782d382884ff65e5c1774e3245d0cf", "ja": "{$P$}……\nあの、私たちにも、何か手伝えることはありませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n请问，有什么我们帮得上忙的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "cda2682e5c0618558d197690e0ae0d12c2805c01d0d0342a2d91832c239b8ed8", "ja": "これは、私たち閃光☆HANABI団のステージです。\nできることなら、なんでもやりますっ！！", "zh": "这是我们『闪光☆HANABI团』的舞台。\n只要是我们办得到的事，我们都愿意做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "dd8fa433170ec9601636fd309f9c6eac014b3fbf0031eb7ba838e3e51cd8fdc5", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど、みんなステージ以外に屋台もある\nだろ？　その上設営の手伝いとなると、さすがに……。", "zh": "我懂你们的心情，但你们除了舞台还要忙摊贩吧？\n如果还叫你们帮忙搭建，未免也太……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "9c8fc97f5cc1486037e48434633f2efe463d7dc5cf7f528b45ede3ed06c8351c", "ja": "水くさいコト言わないでよ、{$P$}！\n人手が足りないんでしょ？", "zh": "别这么见外嘛，{$P$}！\n现在不是人手不够吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "67e95ef24f3259e49c8f570d5bacf0fcd90e9c5dae2689db2852516b2ba890f4", "ja": "アタシたちも手伝いたいんだよ！\nね？　紗代子！", "zh": "我们也想要帮忙啊！\n对吧？纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "e5d83dd22973f3881d0da4dff0e61bdc539cc7a180937d609a734a1f42f8faeb", "ja": "のり子さん……はいっ！", "zh": "法子……对啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "8e6d8e028787f702a361dc373db72d85d506997bbf8245b28e3ee4e84de5e7f4", "ja": "私も、私も手伝う！\n{$P$}、頼りにしていいよーっ☆", "zh": "我也是，我也要帮忙！\n{$P$}，尽管交给我们吧～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "6335220cd6909edfe96277a02d271ac7b104787b9e76830019340091aad06584", "ja": "（どうする……。みんなの気持ちはありがたいが、\nこれ以上負担を増やすのは……）", "zh": "（怎么办……虽然很感谢大家的心意，\n但是再增加她们的负担未免……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "f2fc1e384cbf9a0af0400962525a4acce900dbe8e6d8eb2bd5b85e53de0210cd", "ja": "ふふん。話は聞かせてもらったで、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哼哼，事情我都听到啦，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "dc45c3ef38ccfe750044909ec522870e75b293fc61c419c3cbd6662f8a0072b8", "ja": "私たちにも、お手伝いさせてください！", "zh": "请让我们也一起帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "975e6e698c166e2972adec8c087282df4b11b46e1735ed71ba72d8cb0d52a803", "ja": "うわっ！\n奈緒に美奈子まで……。", "zh": "哇！\n连奈绪和美奈子都来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "6e3ee9e540f4de3e7c42458399ff276e39dfa1753bf8aaf8212f1e46d4183dd8", "ja": "閃光☆HANABI団の気持ちは、ひとつです！\n{$P$}！！", "zh": "『闪光☆HANABI团』一体同心！\n{$P$}！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "7ae199974a07dc3e8bffd4deaa5331e393a7d498bcb02f03fbd93183c519852b", "ja": "……わかった！\nみんな、よろしく頼む！", "zh": "……我明白了！\n各位，就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
